    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/3fcd9607d5e69007cf71089d09b07051.avif?t=1748986441\" data-has-big width=800 height=175 /></span>Mingle is a character-matching game where you move through a crowd to find and merge with your twin. After merging, you become someone new, and the search continues. Play solo or with a friend to see who can match the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/8f4127842a20f8c08eb33cf86d169fba.poster.avif?t=1748986441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/8f4127842a20f8c08eb33cf86d169fba.webm?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/8f4127842a20f8c08eb33cf86d169fba.mp4?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/498f663d361eb6bb558e616d7f0c69c3.avif?t=1748986441\" data-has-big width=800 height=175 /></span>Each level throws a new surprise into the mix to keep you on your toes. Some feature super-fast characters, some shrink over time, and some even try to escape through portals. At the end of every level, you\u2019ll meet and unlock one of hundreds of chatty little characters, each eager to tell you something strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/2e25691d9ad208fbaa95726966146927.poster.avif?t=1748986441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/2e25691d9ad208fbaa95726966146927.webm?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/2e25691d9ad208fbaa95726966146927.mp4?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/ad571d6ad0816eb32494c26c16110e10.avif?t=1748986441\" data-has-big width=800 height=175 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 player couch co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 400 characters, each with their own personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, tough to master, with a three-star rating on every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great for fans of hidden object and tile-matching games looking for something new</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your menu with themed wallpapers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn trophies as you progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/90c492b92ba7d0a35871ff5d973248b4.poster.avif?t=1748986441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/90c492b92ba7d0a35871ff5d973248b4.webm?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/90c492b92ba7d0a35871ff5d973248b4.mp4?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/eaa3507f5c73317009c3b52ae327631f.poster.avif?t=1748986441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/eaa3507f5c73317009c3b52ae327631f.webm?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/eaa3507f5c73317009c3b52ae327631f.mp4?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/3fcd9607d5e69007cf71089d09b07051.avif?t=1748986441\" data-has-big width=800 height=175 /></span>Mingle is a character-matching game where you move through a crowd to find and merge with your twin. After merging, you become someone new, and the search continues. Play solo or with a friend to see who can match the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/8f4127842a20f8c08eb33cf86d169fba.poster.avif?t=1748986441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/8f4127842a20f8c08eb33cf86d169fba.webm?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/8f4127842a20f8c08eb33cf86d169fba.mp4?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/498f663d361eb6bb558e616d7f0c69c3.avif?t=1748986441\" data-has-big width=800 height=175 /></span>Each level throws a new surprise into the mix to keep you on your toes. Some feature super-fast characters, some shrink over time, and some even try to escape through portals. At the end of every level, you\u2019ll meet and unlock one of hundreds of chatty little characters, each eager to tell you something strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/2e25691d9ad208fbaa95726966146927.poster.avif?t=1748986441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/2e25691d9ad208fbaa95726966146927.webm?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/2e25691d9ad208fbaa95726966146927.mp4?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/ad571d6ad0816eb32494c26c16110e10.avif?t=1748986441\" data-has-big width=800 height=175 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 player couch co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 400 characters, each with their own personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, tough to master, with a three-star rating on every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great for fans of hidden object and tile-matching games looking for something new</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your menu with themed wallpapers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn trophies as you progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/90c492b92ba7d0a35871ff5d973248b4.poster.avif?t=1748986441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/90c492b92ba7d0a35871ff5d973248b4.webm?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/90c492b92ba7d0a35871ff5d973248b4.mp4?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/eaa3507f5c73317009c3b52ae327631f.poster.avif?t=1748986441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/eaa3507f5c73317009c3b52ae327631f.webm?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/eaa3507f5c73317009c3b52ae327631f.mp4?t=1748986441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
